MTD	mzTab-version	2.1.0-M
MTD	mzTab-ID	ST000824_AN001310
MTD	mzTab-profile	M+S
MTD	title	2HG concentration in human IDH1m cells
MTD	description	SJGBM2 and MGG8 glioma cells were stable transfected with IDH1-R132H mutated. The expression of IDH1-R132H was confirmed by Western Blot assay. The aim of this project is analyze the production of 2HG in the stable transfected cells (SJGBM-IDH1m and MGG8-IDH1m) compared with the control group WT.
